# HOT-RELOAD-PANEL (owner: «hot reload тогда можно сразу добавить?»): Live Coding (Live++ / UE Live Coding) patches
# an EditorPanels source in the running editor. Patch 1 adds to HistoryPanel.cpp a function and a global the image
# lacks and stores the function's address in the global (a callback into patch memory); patch 2 edits that function
# again, so the stored callback reaches the newest code. The scene, the selection and the camera stay as they were.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Starter.desce
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run Panel "Open History"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 150,450,900
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.45,-1
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,50,0
Когда state
Тогда 0_before the History panel reads "Revision N" with the Box creation and the move listed; the Box is selected (gizmo on it) at the centre of the view
Когда-файл apply Scenarios/Editor/HOT-RELOAD-PANEL.patch
Когда run "Live Coding" "Patch changed sources"
Когда wait-idle
Когда state
Тогда 1_after the History panel reads "Revision (live) N" with the same N and the same two entries; the Box is still selected at the same place, the view is the same camera; editor.log has one "[LiveCoding] patched" line naming HistoryPanel.cpp, "new data:" naming g_HistoryRevisionLabel, and no "[LiveCoding] refused"; no scene open after the patch
Когда-файл apply Scenarios/Editor/HOT-RELOAD-PANEL-2.patch
Когда run "Live Coding" "Patch changed sources"
Когда wait-idle
Когда state
Тогда 2_second the History panel reads "Revision (live 2) N" (the call goes through the pointer patch 1 stored, into patch 1's copy, redirected to patch 2's); selection and camera unchanged; no "[LiveCoding] refused" in editor.log
Когда-файл revert Scenarios/Editor/HOT-RELOAD-PANEL-2.patch
Когда-файл revert Scenarios/Editor/HOT-RELOAD-PANEL.patch
Когда run "Live Coding" "Patch changed sources"
Когда wait-idle
Когда state
Тогда 3_reverted the History panel reads "Revision N" again (OnUIRender patched a third time); selection and camera unchanged; no "[LiveCoding] refused" in editor.log
